  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmarvvinekk.crevado.com%252fwork-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dorpGu2.png\" width=\"1070\" height=\"205\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/marvvinekk/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C59daLc.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fMarvvinekk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bjYhvcf.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>綠寶石裝備！</strong></span></h1><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>綠寶石裝備！</strong>是一款貼近原版風格的Forge模組，實現了Minecraft玩家的<strong>童年夢想</strong>——新增<strong>綠寶石盔甲與工具</strong>套裝。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ey0fNBq.png\" width=\"1476\" height=\"684\"></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">由於<strong>綠寶石在自然界中極其稀有</strong>，這套強力裝備的<strong>傷害值和攻擊速度超越地獄合金</strong>，但代價是耐久度低於鑽石裝備——使其成為冒險者們<strong>高風險高回報</strong>的選擇。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">支援<strong>Forge</strong>、<strong>NeoForge</strong>及<strong>Fabric</strong>平台！<br><br></h4><hr><h4>合成配方遵循原版盔甲與工具的標準格式。</h4><h4>一如既往推薦使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>模組查詢合成表。</h4><h4>盡情享受吧！</h4><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎加入我的伺服器<strong>Squid Abyss</strong>提問、建議新的便利模組或功能，共同決定未來的開發方向！<br><br></h4><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/tP9PZvUNjW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IxYbJ3j.png\" width=\"918\" height=\"275\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4E36BTAWS3HUN\